{"3177340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tower of Madness", "steam_appid": 3177340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower of Madness blends tense exploration, gravity-defying environments, and chilling encounters to keep players on edge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The average time to complete one play-through is 45 minutes.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177340/extras/ae163e8829450af0687f7e54fe27db41.poster.avif?t=1779539629\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177340/extras/ae163e8829450af0687f7e54fe27db41.webm?t=1779539629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177340/extras/ae163e8829450af0687f7e54fe27db41.mp4?t=1779539629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Stylized Horror</strong>: Experience chilling environments filled with terrifying monsters, all brought to life through a unique and immersive art style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177340/extras/040fd4aab6147befe57fef0609222ba0.poster.avif?t=1779539629\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177340/extras/040fd4aab6147befe57fef0609222ba0.webm?t=1779539629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177340/extras/040fd4aab6147befe57fef0609222ba0.mp4?t=1779539629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity Manipulation</strong>: Use red magical glyphs to flip gravity and navigate between ceiling and floor. Progressing through mind-bending environments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by H.P. Lovecraft &amp; Stephen King's The Dark Tower series. An atmospheric, narrative-driven third-person horror game with a distinctive voice and unsettling twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Choices Matter</strong>: Make choices in dialogue and Quick Time Events (QTEs) that determine the fate of John. Discover 1 of 3 different game endings based on your actions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the past</strong>: Find 10 hidden notes to uncover the dark past of the tower. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect &amp; Solve</strong>: Gather keys to unlock new areas and body parts to break through infinite looping hallways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Time Events: </strong>QTE's keep you involved in the action and horror during cutscenes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Storyline</strong>: Follow John on his journey as he faces the darkest corners of his own mind. Fully voice-acted cutscenes add depth to this compelling narrative.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >John has lived all his life in a small, desert town. One fateful day, he starts hearing a sinister voice inside his head. This voice preempts a horrific event—the murder of everyone John knows, right before his eyes. With nowhere else to turn, John is compelled to follow the voice, descending into a dry well that reveals a cavern containing an ominous, inverted floating tower. The voice tells John to follow his crows and ascend this mysterious structure. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower of Madness blends tense exploration, gravity-defying environments, and chilling encounters to keep players on edge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The average time to complete one play-through is 45 minutes.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177340/extras/ae163e8829450af0687f7e54fe27db41.poster.avif?t=1779539629\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177340/extras/ae163e8829450af0687f7e54fe27db41.webm?t=1779539629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177340/extras/ae163e8829450af0687f7e54fe27db41.mp4?t=1779539629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Stylized Horror</strong>: Experience chilling environments filled with terrifying monsters, all brought to life through a unique and immersive art style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177340/extras/040fd4aab6147befe57fef0609222ba0.poster.avif?t=1779539629\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177340/extras/040fd4aab6147befe57fef0609222ba0.webm?t=1779539629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177340/extras/040fd4aab6147befe57fef0609222ba0.mp4?t=1779539629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity Manipulation</strong>: Use red magical glyphs to flip gravity and navigate between ceiling and floor. Progressing through mind-bending environments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by H.P. Lovecraft &amp; Stephen King's The Dark Tower series. An atmospheric, narrative-driven third-person horror game with a distinctive voice and unsettling twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Choices Matter</strong>: Make choices in dialogue and Quick Time Events (QTEs) that determine the fate of John. Discover 1 of 3 different game endings based on your actions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the past</strong>: Find 10 hidden notes to uncover the dark past of the tower. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect &amp; Solve</strong>: Gather keys to unlock new areas and body parts to break through infinite looping hallways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Time Events: </strong>QTE's keep you involved in the action and horror during cutscenes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Storyline</strong>: Follow John on his journey as he faces the darkest corners of his own mind. Fully voice-acted cutscenes add depth to this compelling narrative.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >John has lived all his life in a small, desert town. One fateful day, he starts hearing a sinister voice inside his head. This voice preempts a horrific event—the murder of everyone John knows, right before his eyes. With nowhere else to turn, John is compelled to follow the voice, descending into a dry well that reveals a cavern containing an ominous, inverted floating tower. The voice tells John to follow his crows and ascend this mysterious structure. </p>", "short_description": "A cowboy named John is compelled by an insidious voice in his head to ascend an inverted floating tower. Encounter atmospheric horror, defy gravity, and make impossible choices in this third-person psychological horror game inspired by Stephen King's The Dark Tower.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Fr